  translationDatabase:
  - key: TASK_01
    englishDisplay: 'Welcome to the Vedanta Pot Leakage Training Visualization.


      This
      module covers the Emergency Response Procedure for Side Shell Leakage at Upper
      Location (WI-POT/OPR/019).'
    englishSpeech: Welcome to the Vedanta Pot Leakage Training Visualization. This
      module covers the Emergency Response Procedure for Side Shell Leakage at Upper
      Location.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_02
    englishDisplay: 'Incident Detected: Pot 69.


      An abnormal condition has
      been detected on Pot 69. Visual indicators confirm an upper side shell leakage.


      Immediate
      emergency response protocol must be initiated.'
    englishSpeech: 'Incident Detected: Pot 69. An abnormal condition has been detected
      on Pot 69. Visual indicators confirm an upper side shell leakage. Immediate
      emergency response protocol must be initiated.'
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_03
    englishDisplay: 'Emergency Communication.


      Use the walkie-talkie to immediately
      report the leakage to the Shift Superintendent and Technical In-charge.'
    englishSpeech: Emergency Communication. Use the walkie-talkie to immediately
      report the leakage to the Shift Superintendent and Technical In-charge.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: RADIO_VO_TASK_03
    englishDisplay: Shift Superintendent, Technical In-charge, Pot 69 has developed
      a side shell leakage. The leakage is visible from the upper side of the pot.
    englishSpeech: Shift Superintendent, Technical In-charge, Pot 69 has developed
      a side shell leakage. The leakage is visible from the upper side of the pot.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_04
    englishDisplay: 'Pot Controller Notification.


      Emergency chain activated.
      The Pot Controller broadcasts repeated announcements across the potline.


      "Attention
      all personnel: Pot 69 upper side shell leakage reported. Emergency response
      team proceed to Pot 69."'
    englishSpeech: Pot Controller Notification. Emergency chain activated. The Pot
      Controller broadcasts repeated announcements across the potline.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: POT_CONTROLLER_ANNOUNCEMENT
    englishDisplay: 'Attention all personnel: Pot 69 upper side shell leakage reported.
      Emergency response team proceed to Pot 69.'
    englishSpeech: 'Attention all personnel: Pot 69 upper side shell leakage reported.
      Emergency response team proceed to Pot 69.'
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_05
    englishDisplay: 'Identify Upper Side Shell Leakage.


      Inspect the upper
      side shell area of Pot 69. A continuous narrow stream of molten metal is escaping
      from the upper shell.


      Immediate physical containment actions are required.'
    englishSpeech: Identify Upper Side Shell Leakage. Inspect the upper side shell
      area of Pot 69. A continuous narrow stream of molten metal is escaping from
      the upper shell. Immediate physical containment actions are required.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_06
    englishDisplay: 'Upper Side Shell Response Procedure (WI-POT/OPR/019):


      1.
      Carry out side breaking and remove the affected anode.

      2. Add crust
      bath in small pieces along with fused alumina to choke and seal the leakage
      path.


      Observe gradual reduction in the metal flow.'
    englishSpeech: Upper Side Shell Response Procedure. First, carry out side breaking
      and remove the affected anode. Second, add crust bath in small pieces along
      with fused alumina to choke and seal the leakage path. Observe gradual reduction
      in the metal flow.
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  - key: TASK_07
    englishDisplay: 'Partial Leakage Arrest & Cut-Out Planning.


      Status: LEAKAGE
      PARTIALLY ARRESTED.


      Residual flow is controlled and minimal. Proceed
      with planning for pot cut-out according to the approved potline isolation procedure.'
    englishSpeech: 'Partial Leakage Arrest and Cut-Out Planning. Status: Leakage
      partially arrested. Residual flow is controlled and minimal. Proceed with planning
      for pot cut-out according to the approved potline isolation procedure.'
    hindiDisplay: 
    hindiSpeech: 
    odiaDisplay: 
    odiaSpeech: 
  monitorExternalTrainingJson: 1
  jsonCheckInterval: 2
  debugMode: 0
